Date","label","截图采集","value","2026-10-18","language","en","image","gameplay","The live Godot build: neon territory capture and moving enemies.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/tron-exonix-claude.webp","alt","The neon TRON: EXONIX game board with a player vehicle, moving enemies, and territory boundaries.","https://www.top3d.ai/demo/exonix-build/index.html","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[87],"Claude Code","links","相关资源",[93,94,95,96],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":87,"_25":103},{"_62":101,"_25":102},{"_62":99,"_25":100},{"_62":97,"_25":98},"MCP for Blender","/zh/resources/mcp-for-blender/","Godot MCP · Coding-Solo","/zh/resources/godot-mcp/","Godot Engine · Official Documentation","/zh/resources/godot-engine/","/zh/resources/claude-code/","创作者开发记录",[107],"evidence",{"_62":108,"_25":109,"_110":111},"Read how the agent workflow was assembled","https://github.com/witnesstodark/tron-exonix/blob/master/CLAUDE.md","note","The creator’s reproducible setup record explains the AI’s implementation work, human material review, generation tools, and local launch requirements.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[116],{"_62":117,"_25":118,"_110":119},"Open the complete Godot game project","https://github.com/witnesstodark/tron-exonix","Includes the Godot project, scripts, shaders, models, textures, audio, and generation scripts. Local play requires Godot 4.7 standard; API access is only needed to regenerate assets.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[125],{"_62":126,"_25":75,"_110":127},"Play TRON: EXONIX","Creator-hosted Godot web build. Click to enter the grid, press Space to deploy, use the arrow keys to move, and Escape for the menu. A keyboard and a WebGL-capable browser are recommended.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","教程","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[135],{"_62":136,"_25":137,"_110":-7},"Follow the creator’s complete workflow","https://www.top3d.ai/learn/claude-godot-mcp-3d-game","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[142,143,144,14